	(text "2. U1 LM2596S-5 buck (fixed 5 V, 150 kHz): OUT -> L1 33 uH -> +5 V; D2 SS54 is the free-wheel diode (switch node to GND); FB senses +5 V; ~ON/OFF tied to GND (always on)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.376 201.676 0)
